{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾為動畫《鬼滅之刃》、《葬送的芙莉蓮》唱片尾曲的日本創作歌姬milet，將於明年重臨香港，1月24日假亞洲博覽館Arena開騷。</p><p>入行7年的她，憑仙氣外形與出色唱功走紅樂壇，但成名背後卻付出沉重的健康代價。</p><p>她去年曾因健康問題突然停工休養4個月</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.234732+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T02:44:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"61543addc3c46d0abbbd175066031876a6c5e2184b958ef0a2597b30d6439dc0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}